            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tammy Lynn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used a large frozen banana, vanilla yogurt and left out the sugar and whipped cream. It is an okay smoothie. The original proportions and ingredients wouldn't produce the best results.",
